            "en": [
              "* School vacations Thursday to Saturday 10am to 12pm and 3:30pm to 6:30pm and Sunday 10am to 12:30pm.\r\n* Off-season Saturday to Sunday mornings (winter only Saturday afternoons and Sunday mornings)"
            ],
            "it": [
              "* Vacanze scolastiche da giovedì a sabato dalle 10 alle 12 e dalle 15.30 alle 18.30 e domenica dalle 10 alle 12.30.\r\n* Fuori stagione da sabato a domenica mattina (in inverno solo sabato pomeriggio e domenica mattina)"
            ],
            "fr": [
              "* Vacances scolaires du jeudi au samedi de 10h à 12h et de 15h30 à 18h30 et dimanche de 10h 12h30.\r\n* Hors saison du samedi au dimanche matin (hiver juste le samedi après-midi et dimanche matin)"
